  "protocolVersion": null,
  "instructions": "Long-term memory shared by all sessions and projects: a knowledge graph of the user's projects, their dependencies, versions, pending work and rules learned from failures. Before reading code for a task, open_nodes the exact names of the projects, packages and services it touches with related: true (search_nodes if unsure of a name), then the rules and pending work it lists that bear on the task; treat what you read as claims to re-verify. When work changes state (version bump, publish, deploy, config change, new service, lesson from a failure), record it at once as a dated observation of one short fact (under 150 characters), replacing a stale fact with replace_observation instead of appending a correction. Never store secrets, only where they live.",
